"evidence": "Brochure Page 11"
},
{
"name": "Mr. Yogendra Kumar Choudhary",
"role": "R&D Leadership",
"evidence": "Brochure Page 11"
}
],
"history": "Dayjoy Marketing Private Limited was incorporated in 2018 and officially launched its direct selling operations in 2019. It has since expanded to a franchise network of over 1,000 outlets across India and successfully expanded internationally to Nepal in May 2024.",
