"fssai": "License Number 12224999000129. Valid up to 11-03-2030. Licensed as Relabeller, General Manufacturer, Vegetable oil processing, Trader, Retailer, e-Commerce, and Importer.",
"gmp": "Operates under strict WHO-GMP compliance, holding a Certificate of GMP. Overseen by Dr. Ram Pal Somani to ensure Ayurvedic and health supplements meet classical science and world-class manufacturing standards.",
"policies": "Privacy Policy (effective Aug 12, 2019) ensures data protection. Buy Back/Exchange/Refund Policy allows returns within 30 days (5% handling charge for marketable goods; unmarketable assessed manually). Shipping Policy requires discrepancy notification within 24 hours. Social Media Policy strictly requires disclaimers and prohibits using company logos in paid ads. Payment Gateway Policy utilizes PAYU & RAZORPAY.",
"compliance": "Complies with the Information Technology Act 2000 (Section 43A and 72A) for data privacy, FSS Act 2006 for food safety, and the Arbitration Conciliation Act 1996 for dispute resolution exclusively in Kota, Rajasthan courts. Features a strict Income Disclaimer indicating earnings are not guaranteed."
},
